  (text "1.  +3V3 is generated by U7 (AMS1117CD-3.3) from the USB-C +5V rail; every IC has a 100nF decoupling cap at its supply pin."
    (at 27.0 482.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid edd71563-3f08-4db0-a630-61d28e2321cb)
  )
  (text "2.  EVERY SLOT  J2..J9 = 1:+5V  2:GND  3:AO  4:DO  5:3V3  6:ID   (a 4-pin MQ-type module seats on pins 1-4)."
    (at 27.0 491.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 30069e9f-2093-4e7e-b323-3a3325be660d)
  )
  (text "3.  QWIIC PORT  J11..J18 = 1:GND  2:3V3  3:SDA  4:SCL   (each port is one TCA9548A channel; channel n <-> slot n)."
    (at 27.0 500.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid fb9c6482-de29-430e-b391-8024cbe1ea76)
  )
  (text "4.  I2C ADDRESSES  ADS1115 0x48 (slots 0-3) / 0x49 (slots 4-7)   TCA9548A 0x70   SHT31 0x44   DISPLAY 0x3C (master bus)."
    (at 27.0 509.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 841e78ef-a9ba-4b86-971b-a9b6029e55fe)
  )
  (text "5.  1-Wire ID: all eight slot ID pins share one open-drain bus with a 4.7k pull-up; v1 leaves per-module identity to the host application."
    (at 27.0 518.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 429fdd21-8a39-42cb-9ccd-421bcd9ed881)
  )
  (text "6.  J20 = 1x05 front-panel button harness: 1 MEASURE, 2 BUTTON_MENU, 3 BOOT, 4 EN (RESET), 5 GND.  Each panel button shorts its pin to GND."
    (at 27.0 527.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 8f1ff771-4cd6-4df9-906f-1573fdf77f6d)
  )
  (text "7.  J19 = Qwiic OLED cable entry for the sealed FRONT-WALL bezel on the MASTER I2C bus; C10 decouples its 3V3 supply at the header.  The lid is plain: no display, no button holes."
    (at 27.0 536.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 7a064a4e-cd57-45d6-841d-fdcd2c2e32f1)
  )
  (text "8.  Connectivity is carried by net-name labels; the authoritative pin/net model is electrical/board.py (validated, ERC-clean)."
    (at 27.0 545.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid daed9d8a-24cc-4a60-ba12-8b26b6734f7c)
  )
  (text "9.  NC = not connected (no-connect flag placed).   All dimensions mm; passives 0603 unless noted."
    (at 27.0 554.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 39c96197-81ca-402d-9054-d5b9c1f7fe6f)
  )

